/steamcommunity.com/id/turtlneck/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 105078, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 62338, "last_played": 1789358266, "avatar": "1f11aa948f21960cb6e64588f08be88158640095"}, "language": "english", "review": "i've played 1,000 hours of this game and i think only 10 of them have been outside of a sci-fi setting", "timestamp_created": 1752614785, "timestamp_updated": 1752614800, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 8, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "199887700", "author": {"steamid": "76561198087529864", "personaname": "DragonPlus7", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198087529864/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 214, "playtime_forever": 108, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 108, "last_played": 1750514245, "avatar": "fcfdf350ff6990d0be1beb45cea526deeb4542c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "it doesnt tell you how to play online, the tutorial is massive really MASSIVE it will take you years! just to learn and sometimes you get stuck. The game itself trys to be a simulation but really turns out to be an RPG. It has RPG mechanics, if you run you lose stamina, when you lose stamina your recoil is terrible you cannot hit anything seriously its an RPG built on warfare. Without stamina ALL your shots dont hit i swear even if your aim straight the mechanics are from years ago. The online is so difficult to play it doesnt tell you how to play you gotta ask people online geez.  If you want to play online and use a Helicopter, you cant because there are only 4 slots for a pilot, terrible it not like battlefield where you can just click e and jump on a heli or a plane. You fly as a passenger for 15mins yeah seriously 15 mins, then INSTA death from ANti-AIR guns. MAPS are HUGE. I'll stick to watching streams coz this game would take your life to learn. It also has a massive following of MODS. The worst is the DLC it should be included in the game , coz you can use the helis, tanks and planes without the DLC. This game is not for me you have to be very committed to play but i believe its a good game for those types of player without a life", "timestamp_created": 1752612726, "timestamp_updated": 1752612896, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494145989418029785", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199883199", "author": {"steamid": "76561198210207188", "personaname": "JosipTLG", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198210207188/", "num_games_owned": 181, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 3520, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2851, "last_played": 1788029985, "avatar": "43c2afa61c6b3af7cfec62e037190bdbe493e6ec"}, "language": "english", "review": "ts pmo 🥀", "timestamp_created": 1752608709, "timestamp_updated": 1752615845, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}